DESCRIPTION=docs/ROADMAP.md is the sole platform doc: phased roadmap (P0–P9), platform credibility gaps with normative references and rough implementation (H→K→B), Appendix standards map, and Appendix D (merged bare-metal Improve-Sys-Architecture checklist: GIC, IDT/vectors, PMM, PS/2, devfs, spinlocks, execution order). Phase 3: IEEE 802.3 / RFC 894/826. Link from docs/build.md.
